---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import LaunchpadSandbox from '../components/LaunchpadSandbox';
import { ArrowRight, ExternalLink, GitBranch, Layers, ShieldCheck } from '@lucide/astro';

const commercial = '/brand/campaign/take-it-with-you-20261118';
---
<Base title="Build something people can use" description="Shape a real app from reusable parts in the browser, then take the same validated blueprint to your own coding agent and your own Cloudflare account.">
 <div class="demo-heading">
  <p class="eyebrow">Try it now · no account</p>
  <h1>Build something people can use. Keep it yours.</h1>
  <p class="lede">Shape a real app from reusable parts, then hand the same settings to your own coding agent. The preview updates as you work. Nothing is deployed until you and your agent choose to deploy it.</p>
  <div class="actions">
   <a class="button" href="#lp-preview">Start changing this app <ArrowRight size={18} aria-hidden="true"/></a>
   <a class="button secondary" href="/demo/screening-room">Make a screening room</a>
   <a class="button secondary" href="/demo/examples">Try a finished project</a>
  </div>
 </div>

 <LaunchpadSandbox client:visible />

 <noscript><p>The interactive preview needs JavaScript. You can still <a href="/creator-hub">open the published Creator Hub</a>, <a href="/demo/connected-apps">read the connected-apps walkthrough</a> or <a href="/init">start a project brief</a>.</p></noscript>

 <section class="demo-section" aria-labelledby="after-title">
  <h2 id="after-title">What happens after the preview</h2>
  <ol class="demo-steps">
   <li><strong>You keep the brief.</strong> The download is the same versioned specification Init uses: name, introduction, theme, layout, links and which apps you chose.</li>
   <li><strong>Your agent does the build.</strong> It works in your GitHub and Cloudflare accounts, from your own copy of the source. You approve spending, new accounts and domains.</li>
   <li><strong>Review before public.</strong> A contribution stays private until the owner approves it. Hiding one removes it from every public view that reads the source.</li>
   <li><strong>Change it again later.</strong> A later change keeps your content, saved versions and owner data. The Creator Hub shows a real follow-up release on the same address.</li>
  </ol>
  <p class="demo-note"><ShieldCheck size={16} aria-hidden="true"/> The sandbox stores its state in this browser only. It never writes to a production database, a hosted resource or another owner's collection.</p>
 </section>

 <section class="demo-section" aria-labelledby="real-title">
  <h2 id="real-title">The real version of this</h2>
  <div class="demo-links">
   <a href="/creator-hub"><Layers size={20} aria-hidden="true"/><strong>Creator Hub</strong><span>A home for your work, built with an agent and changed after release.</span></a>
   <a href="/demo/connected-apps"><GitBranch size={20} aria-hidden="true"/><strong>Two apps, one collection</strong><span>The photo guestbook and Linkarooie, with the ownership peel and revisions.</span></a>
   <a href="/demo/workshop"><Layers size={20} aria-hidden="true"/><strong>Illustrated workshop</strong><span>Explore Paperwork, LDraw and Analytics in a playful 3D demo.</span></a>
   <a href="https://creator-hub-guestbook.loftwah.com"><ExternalLink size={20} aria-hidden="true"/><strong>Live guestbook</strong><span>Submit a fictional note and see the moderation path on a real deployment.</span></a>
  </div>
 </section>

 <p><a href="/demo/postcards/edit">Edit a sample postcard collection</a></p>
 <section class="demo-section" aria-labelledby="next-title">
  <h2 id="next-title">Start your own</h2>
  <p>Choose your app, name it and prepare the brief. <a href="/init">Open Init</a> when you are ready for a real build, or <a href="/ready">get your environment ready first</a>. The build and deployment belong to your agent; <a href="/release">the release page</a> records what has actually been verified.</p>
 </section>

 <section class="demo-section" id="commercial" aria-labelledby="commercial-title">
  <h2 id="commercial-title">Take it with you</h2>
  <figure class="commercial">
   <video controls playsinline preload="none" width="1280" height="720" poster={commercial + '.webp'} aria-label="App Composer commercial">
    <source src={commercial + '.mp4'} type="video/mp4" />
    <track kind="captions" src={commercial + '.vtt'} srclang="en" label="English captions" />
    <a href={commercial + '.mp4'}>Open the App Composer commercial</a>
   </video>
   <figcaption><a href={commercial + '.txt'}>Read the transcript</a></figcaption>
  </figure>
 </section>
</Base>
<style>
 .demo-heading{max-width:900px;margin-bottom:36px}
 .demo-heading h1{font-size:clamp(2.6rem,5.4vw,4.6rem);max-width:19ch;text-wrap:balance;margin:10px 0 20px}
 .demo-heading .lede{max-width:56ch}
 .demo-section{border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);margin-top:56px;padding-top:32px}
 .demo-section h2{font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3vw,2.4rem);max-width:24ch}
 .demo-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:0 44px;max-width:none;padding-left:22px;margin:24px 0 0}
 .demo-steps li{margin:0;padding:16px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border)}
 .demo-steps strong{display:block;margin-bottom:6px}
 .demo-steps li{color:var(--color-muted)}
 .commercial{margin:20px 0 0;max-width:720px}
 .commercial video{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}
 .demo-note{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin-top:24px;font-size:14px;color:var(--color-muted);max-width:70ch}
 .demo-note svg{flex:none;margin-top:3px;color:var(--color-accent)}
 .demo-links{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px;margin-top:24px}
 .demo-links a{display:block;padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:10px;background:var(--color-surface);text-decoration:none}
 .demo-links a:hover{border-color:var(--color-accent)}
 .demo-links svg{color:var(--color-accent)}
 .demo-links strong{display:block;margin:12px 0 6px;font-size:1.05rem}
 .demo-links span{display:block;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--color-muted)}
 @media(max-width:900px){.demo-links{grid-template-columns:1fr}.demo-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}.demo-section{margin-top:40px;padding-top:26px}}
</style>
